WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.959 --> 00:00:05.640
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and in my last
couple of Doctor Who videos I asked you all

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:10.740
to submit questions about the new character
Danny Pink and Series 8, so I picked 10 of

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.860
them to answer in this video with one bonus
question.

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:17.020
There’s also been a lot of talk about a
new Master that ties in with the new Danny

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:23.380
Pink character, so I tried to pick a couple
of those questions.

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:27.729
I’ve also got a big announcement, I’m
going to be changing my youtube avatar soon.

00:00:27.729 --> 00:00:33.160
It’s going to probably be a version of this
Sherlock Chibi with my eye color.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:37.530
You can let me know whether you like that
idea or think it’s terrible.

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:42.300
It will still be on the blue background like
it is now but it probably won’t have the

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.300
text.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:44.500
I don’t know when exactly it’s going to
be finished.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:47.179
But I’ll let you know who the artist is
when it’s done so you can see her other

00:00:47.179 --> 00:00:48.179
fandom chibis.

00:00:48.179 --> 00:00:51.219
I’m also going to be doing a video for all
the rumored episode titles and details for

00:00:51.219 --> 00:00:52.219
series 8.

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:53.579
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:00:53.579 --> 00:00:58.289
Even if it turns out to not be true it’s
still a good jumping off point for talking

00:00:58.289 --> 00:01:00.402
about the stories we want to see during series
8.

00:01:00.402 --> 00:01:02.550
Now, time to answer some questions, Number
1 - Cure 9269 says what about Steven John

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:04.269
Shepherd from East Enders?

00:01:04.269 --> 00:01:09.040
He even grew a beard and said he’s working
on something secret.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.530
So Steven said he was working on something
secret and then took this picture of himself

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:17.900
with a Classic Who Master Beard on the South
Whales Coastline, Doctor Who was actually

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:22.010
filming Series 8 near that area around the
time that picture was taken.

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:26.000
So the Mirror is reporting that he could have
been filming scenes with Doctor Who as The

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.000
Master.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:34.280
It’s a long shot and this is the only evidence
we have, so let’s add him to the top 5 potential

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:35.590
new Masters.

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:40.010
Question 2 - Incroyable Dalek asks Will Capaldis
screwdriver be the one that river song will

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:41.150
give him?

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:45.289
I don’t think so, River’s Screwdriver
from Silence in the Library Forest of the

00:01:45.289 --> 00:01:47.149
Dead was featured in the Series 6 short Last
Night.

00:01:47.149 --> 00:01:48.630
I think Capaldi will get a new one.

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:52.170
I’m sure they’ll use the moment to tell
some more regeneration jokes, but we have

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:53.800
no idea what it will look like.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:57.490
Hopefully they’ll reveal an image of it
while they’re still filming or at least

00:01:57.490 --> 00:01:59.360
at Comic Con this summer.

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:04.979
Question 3 - Kitty Kerosene says What if the
Danny Pink character is a Red Herring?

00:02:04.979 --> 00:02:10.450
So good comment, you’re talking about Moffat
using the Danny Pink persona as a mask for

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:11.880
something more sinister.

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:16.140
Like Samuel Anderson is playing another character
pretending to be Danny Pink.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:20.720
There was a recent blog post on Katerborous
that claims Danny Pink may be the new Master.

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:24.720
I think it would be an interesting twist,
a teacher at a very famous School in the Doctor

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:29.200
Who Universe, one that the current companion
just happens to work at, turns out to secretly

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:30.200
be The Master.

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:35.970
Derek Jacobi’s Master stored his true self
in the pocket watch, so if Danny Pink pulls

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:40.210
one out we can all “oh shit” high five
each other.

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:46.700
Question 4 - JER asks will series 8 will have
episode pairs like series 1-6 or none like

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:47.700
series 7?

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:51.930
No, I think generally people were upset that
they had to wait so long to get the second

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:54.950
half of series 7 and it seems like the BBC
listened.

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:58.560
Moffat has said that the season will air all
the episodes in consecutive weeks.

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:01.900
There hasn’t been an official announcement
about the Christmas Special.

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:08.970
But I think we should expect one.

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:15.110
Question 5 - Amelia Pond asks Do you think
danny may be some companion's relatives/ son

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:16.110
and might he be the new mickey smith?﻿

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:21.930
No, I think given the level of rumors that
he is secretly someone else, he’s not biologically

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.410
related to any of the other characters.

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:29.710
If he is the Master or just someone bad, then
I’m sure there will be some implied shared

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:31.340
history with The Doctor.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:35.430
In all likelihood, he just knows Clara like
people who work together get to know each

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:36.770
other.

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:41.220
Question 6 - Khiya Hillyard asks There's a
speculation going around that capaldi's only

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:43.240
going to be around for one series.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:44.580
What do you think?

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:48.580
His contract is currently only for series
8.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:50.710
That doesn’t mean he’ll only do one series.

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:54.300
He has been a life long fan of Doctor Who,
so he does have a lot of reverence for the

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.300
role.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:59.630
Most of the time actors leave because they
get tired creatively or have better opportunities

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:00.630
elsewhere.

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:03.940
Like Matt Smith and Karen Gillan’s movie
careers taking off in Hollywood.

00:04:03.940 --> 00:04:08.070
If Capaldi does only stay for one series it
would present some interesting challenges

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:09.360
to the story.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:12.420
How would the finale work and then wouldn’t
they have to do another Christmas Special

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.380
regeneration like last year.

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:16.760
Also, casting new Doctors can be difficult.

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:21.560
They announced Capaldi before the 50th Anniversary
and I think they cast him within a couple

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.070
months of Matt Smith announcing he was leaving.

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:28.229
So if Capaldi ends up leaving, they would
have to announce it pretty soon.

00:04:28.229 --> 00:04:33.539
Question 7 - crazybrownie101 asks Since series
8 is supposed to be like classic who, do you

00:04:33.539 --> 00:04:37.819
think they will combine the seriousness of
that and the funniness of the modern series

00:04:37.819 --> 00:04:38.819
together?

00:04:38.819 --> 00:04:42.469
Yes absolutely, if you’ve seen some of the
behind the scenes images from the first episode

00:04:42.469 --> 00:04:46.759
you can see Capaldi making funny faces, so
there will definitely be some awkward humor

00:04:46.759 --> 00:04:48.189
at first.

00:04:48.189 --> 00:04:51.350
Him just getting used to his new self and
Clara getting used to him.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:55.820
The first couple of episodes are directed
by Ben Wheatley, who has done a lot of classic

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:57.229
70s Horror stuff.

00:04:57.229 --> 00:05:01.129
So I think his episodes will be serious, just
given that he’s a horror afficionado.

00:05:01.129 --> 00:05:03.020
The rest of the season remains to be seen
though.

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:07.500
When I do my video breaking down all the episode
rumors, I’ll try to talk about each of the

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:11.490
directors and how their previous episodes
might inform what the tone of the new stuff

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:12.490
will be.

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:17.159
Question 8 - minembo asks Do you know if any
old companions excluding river,amy, and Rory

00:05:17.159 --> 00:05:18.949
are coming back?﻿

00:05:18.949 --> 00:05:26.789
Outside of the ones you mentioned no, it’s
possible that since both Clara and a new Character

00:05:26.789 --> 00:05:30.490
work at Coal Hill School that there will be
a few classic companion cameos.

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:33.610
But if they do appear, it would probably be
as different characters than they originally

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:35.030
played.

00:05:35.030 --> 00:05:40.069
Question 9 - BB Plays games asks Do you think
in series 8, Capaldi's doctor will meet any

00:05:40.069 --> 00:05:42.680
of his previous selves trying to find Gallifrey?

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:47.240
No, but a lot of people are taking the quote
from Tom Baker during the 50th Anniversary

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:48.660
to mean that.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:52.509
I think his comment about revisiting old faces
just means that there will be more classic

00:05:52.509 --> 00:05:54.849
doctors in the next Anniversary Special.

00:05:54.849 --> 00:05:56.770
Which will probably happen in 5 years.

00:05:56.770 --> 00:06:00.560
I don’t think they’ll wait a full 10 years
to do another one.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:05.569
5 years is a long time in television.

00:06:05.569 --> 00:06:11.469
Question 10 - Lotsafuntano asks When River
Song first told Doc #10 his name, to prove

00:06:11.469 --> 00:06:15.779
she was trustworthy, she apologized and looked
so terribly sad.

00:06:15.779 --> 00:06:17.779
When she whispered it to him, he looked horrified.

00:06:17.779 --> 00:06:21.749
He says, "There is only one reason I would
tell you my name."

00:06:21.749 --> 00:06:24.789
From the look on his face the reason is, obviously,
a horrifying reason.

00:06:24.789 --> 00:06:28.229
Have there been any theories as to what this
reason will be?

00:06:28.229 --> 00:06:32.069
My first thought after seeing it was that
in the future the Doctor told her his name

00:06:32.069 --> 00:06:33.949
as he lay dying.

00:06:33.949 --> 00:06:36.889
As in his final death.

00:06:36.889 --> 00:06:39.370
Since that’s such an abstract concept, like
the Valeyard.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:44.680
I don’t think Doctor Who the series will
ever show the Doctor’s final death.

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:48.610
Hopefully the show runs forever, but I think
logically they would end it in a way that

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:52.219
allows the Doctor to continue even if he’s
not on TV anymore.

00:06:52.219 --> 00:06:55.599
The story would just continue in book stories
and Big Finish audio dramas.

00:06:55.599 --> 00:06:58.430
That’s just my interpretation of that scene
though.

00:06:58.430 --> 00:07:01.400
Bonus Question - This isn’t really a question
but it’s really cool.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:05.969
commenter Husk JV was actually at the Newcastle
comic con where Sylvester McCoy said he knew

00:07:05.969 --> 00:07:06.990
who the next Master was.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:09.270
So I’m just going to read their comment
in full.

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:13.970
And they say, “I was actually there at Newcastle
Film and Comic Con when Sylvester McCoy told

00:07:13.970 --> 00:07:18.650
us, it was odd that it went out so quickly
though - there was only about 70 of us watching

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:26.050
the talk (masquerade was on :s), and I saw
only one pull their phone out (assuming for

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.270
twitter or something.)

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:32.889
The funny thing was everyone just looked at
each other, then back to Sylvester again.﻿”

00:07:32.889 --> 00:07:40.469
Based on your comment it’s hard to tell
if McCoy was just joking, he is super funny

00:07:40.469 --> 00:07:41.469
in real life.

00:07:41.469 --> 00:07:44.729
I think he would be pulling some legs by saying
he knew who the Master was.

00:07:44.729 --> 00:07:48.599
There’s really no way to know who knows
all of the actors coming and going for meetings

00:07:48.599 --> 00:07:52.009
about potential roles even the smaller ones.

00:07:52.009 --> 00:07:55.870
There were rumors that people knew the new
Doctor was Peter Capaldi was the new Doctor

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:59.279
within days of Matt Smith announcing he was
leaving.

00:07:59.279 --> 00:08:03.569
I think it’s just important to keep in mind
that things change all the time.

00:08:03.569 --> 00:08:10.930
Matt Smith announced he was doing series 8
in 2012 and changed his mind after Series

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:11.930
7 finished airing.

00:08:11.930 --> 00:08:12.930
So still lot’s to talk about.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:16.039
Thanks so much for submitting questions, this
was a ton of fun as always.

00:08:16.039 --> 00:08:19.210
Like I said, my next Doctor Who video will
probably be a breakdown of everything we know

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:20.840
about the Series 8 episodes.

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:22.069
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:08:22.069 --> 00:08:25.319
I’ll try to post that either this weekend
or early next week.

